### 3.1 Get all persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### 3.2 & 3.18 Get info
GET http://localhost:3001/info

### 3.3 & 3.18 Get single person (valid ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6ac78bb129b83a3b1c264563

### 3.16 & 3.18 Get single person (malformatted ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/invalid-id

### 3.18 Get single person (non-existing ID)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6ac78bb129b83a3b1c264560

### 3.15 Delete a person
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6ac78bb129b83a3b1c264563

### 3.14 Create a new person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Linus Torvalds",
  "number": "040-5556667"
}

### 3.17 Update person number (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6ac78bb129b83a3b1c264563
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anna",
  "number": "040-9998887"
}

